<view class="guide-page assessment-hub">
  <view class="guide-hero hub-hero">
    <view class="guide-kicker">测评</view>
    <view class="guide-title">先分清要解决的问题。</view>
    <view class="guide-subtitle">选校工具用于缩小范围；学习测评用于了解孩子当前能力。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="hub-options">
    <view class="hub-option" hover-class="guide-press" bindtap="goSelection">
      <view class="hub-number">01</view><view class="hub-main"><view class="hub-title">智能选校</view><view class="hub-meta">约2分钟 · 无需登录</view><view class="hub-note">根据年龄、预算、课程偏好和家庭条件生成候选学校。</view></view><view class="guide-arrow">›</view>
    </view>
    <view class="hub-option" hover-class="guide-press" bindtap="goReadiness">
      <view class="hub-number">02</view><view class="hub-main"><view class="hub-title">入学准备度测评</view><view class="hub-meta">约30–45分钟 · 顾问确认后发码</view><view class="hub-note">了解英语、数学、科学或任务表现，报告由老师复核。</view><view class="hub-state" wx:if="{{hasRequest || hasSession}}">{{hasSession ? '继续测评或查看报告' : '查看评估码申请进度'}}</view></view><view class="guide-arrow">›</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="guide-notice">测评结果用于教育咨询和准备建议，不是学校、MOE或AEIS官方成绩，也不预测录取。</view>
</view>
<guide-nav active="assessment" />
